---
title: Troubleshooting
sidebar:
  order: 5
---

If the build fails in a way that doesn't make sense, such as after you update DX, hold **Shift** and select the **Play** button on the toolbar. Diorama64 deletes the files from earlier builds and builds the mod from scratch.

If you're stuck, ask in the [`#diorama64`](https://discord.com/channels/279322074412089344/1559222235934498929) channel on the [Star Haven Discord server](https://discord.gg/pwhSQbH). Say what you were doing and what went wrong, and include Diorama64's log, which **Help > Open Log File** opens.

If you've found a bug in Diorama64, report it with **Help > Report a Bug**.
